		(comment 1 "DRAFT, DO NOT POWER")
		(comment 2 "LM74700+PXN012 (PD_SINK) || LTC4412+AONR21357 (VSYS) -> VIN_LAB -> TPS55289 0x74 500 kHz")
		(comment 3 "Chain: V_TPS-S1-X-R1 10m-A-(SW_HS|SW_HF)-Y-S2-P2; A-R2 1R-B-R3 100R-Y, SW_M on R3; P1-PTC-S3-X")
		(comment 4 "VSYS/AON-interlocked VOM LED rail; all range gate drivers floating; RANGE_H=logic command (not gate feedback); Vout<=15V, CC<=2.5A firmware worst-case code pending")
		(comment 5 "Reverse polarity on enabled output forbidden; passive SRC-negative dumps only mitigate large negative faults, no guaranteed off-time/INA -0.3V transient survival")
		(comment 6 "INA clamp DNP: X leakage is upstream shunts, Y/P2 leakage is measured; negative OFF terminal DC prevents unilateral terminal clamp; crowbar Tjmax150C")
